     n=36: floor sum = 11010, RHS(1) = 22015/2, Z_3(n) = 5, deviation = Z_3/2 = 5/2
  FINITE-EXACT  e=3: identity sum floor(k^e/n) = (sum k^e)/n - (n-1)/2 holds on [2,1200] iff squarefree
  FINITE-EXACT  e=5: identity sum floor(k^e/n) = (sum k^e)/n - (n-1)/2 holds on [2,1200] iff squarefree
  FINITE-EXACT  e=7: identity sum floor(k^e/n) = (sum k^e)/n - (n-1)/2 holds on [2,1200] iff squarefree
